      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know what to do anymore. the debt is just... it's everywhere. every time i think i've made a dent, another bill comes or the interest just jumps. i feel like i'm drowning and there's literally no way out. like i'm just stuck in this cycle forever. its exhausting.",
